sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin Operator
    participant UI as Admin Chat Drawer
    participant Server as Express (/api/admin/ai/ask)
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini 3.6 Flash
    participant Service as Admin Billing Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    Admin->>UI: Types query ("Show me all unpaid bills")
    UI->>Server: POST /api/admin/ai/ask { message, history }
    Server->>Gemini: ai.models.generateContent(prompt + billing tools)
    
    Gemini-->>Server: Function Call Requested: getUnpaidBillsTool()
    
    Server->>Service: getUnpaidBills({ limit: 100 })
    Service->>DB: SELECT * FROM freight_bills WHERE status = 'Unpaid'
    DB-->>Service: Database Result Rows
    Service-->>Server: JSON Tool Results
    
    Server->>Gemini: Send Tool Output back to Gemini
    Gemini-->>Server: Final Generated Text (Natural response with verified ₹ amounts)
    
    Server-->>UI: 200 OK { reply, toolsUsed: ['getUnpaidBills'] }
    UI-->>Admin: Displays formatted markdown response with badge
